# npm pack resolves ignore rules HERE (package root), not the repo root,
# so the .mimosa/ entry must exist in this file too. Runtime hazard: the
# Mimosa security hook writes session status into the working directory;
# one such file inside src/ silently became the 43rd tarball member and
# broke release sha parity (autoclav review 60). *.tgz matches the root
# convention and keeps packed artifacts out of git as well.
.mimosa/
*.tgz
